  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-27",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In the shorter term, the Company expects to meet its production expectations of 33-50MW of finished product and a total stack production in excess of 55MW.",
   "file": "20220127_ITM_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-09",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Deferral of 24 MW Leuna delivery of completed products and therefore revenue recognition of approximately £11m into FY23",
   "file": "20220609_ITM_Trading-&-Corporate-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-08-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company confirms that its current operational and financial position remains in line with the trading update of 9 June.",
   "file": "20220801_ITM_Notice-of-Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-14",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "That said, with lead times stretching within many supply markets in FY22 as a result of macroeconomic conditions, the focus in the next financial year will be on delivering what is already contracted, with 60% to 80% of the MW in contracted work in progress expected to be recognised in FY23.",
   "file": "20220914_ITM_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-27",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Due to manufacturing issues including delays in finalising the tooling and testing of these stacks, the Company now expects that full year output and revenue is likely to be towards the bottom of the current guidance range.",
   "file": "20221027_ITM_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-16",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Whilst the process is ongoing, it has become clear that the outcome for the financial year ending 30 April 2023 will be materially different from the current guidance, with lower revenue and a higher EBITDA loss.",
   "file": "20230116_ITM_Trading-&-Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-31",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Based on the products revenue recognised in the first half, we therefore expect revenue for the full year to be c.£2.0m.",
   "file": "20230131_ITM_Interim-Results-and-Strategic-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-06-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Adjusted EBITDA loss of between £90m to £95m, within the £85m to £95m guidance",
   "file": "20230601_ITM_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-25",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board confirms the guidance provided at the time of our trading update on 1 June 2023.",
